ss to and use of the Platform, including the purchase of goods, participation in promotions, and use of services provided by </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A40273"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr><w:t>Damndeal</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A40273"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr><w:t>.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="688EE5DA" w14:textId="26847244" w:rsidR="003F4788" w:rsidRPr="001F6DAA" w:rsidRDefault="00A40273" w:rsidP="00A40273"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:before="120" w:after="120"/><w:jc w:val="both"/><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A40273"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr><w:t>By registering on, accessing, browsing, or otherwise using the Platform in any manner, You acknowledge that You have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by this Agreement and all other policies referenced herein, including but not limited to the Refund Policy, Reward Policy, Privacy Policy, and Vendor Terms.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="33D0ECCE" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="003F4788" w:rsidRDefault="003F4788" w:rsidP="001A7E40"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:before="120" w:after="120"/><w:jc w:val="both"/><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="001F6DAA"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr><w:t>Damndeal</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="001F6DAA"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr><w:t xml:space="preserve"> reserves the right to amend, modify, or terminate this Policy at any time at its sole discretion without prior notice, subject to applicable laws and regulations.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="55EDB2D2" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="0043740D" w:rsidRPr="001F6DAA" w:rsidRDefault="0043740D" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:before="120" w:after="120"/><w:jc w:val="both"/><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="001F6DAA"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr><w:t>THIS POLICY DOES NOT OVERRIDE OR MODIFY VENDOR LIABILITIES, PRODUCT WARRANTIES, OR OTHER SERVICE AGREEMENTS MADE BETWEEN THIRD-PARTY VENDORS AND USERS.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="78D4800F" w14:textId="65414918" w:rsidR="003F4788" w:rsidRPr="001F6DAA" w:rsidRDefault="005E5D6D" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="005E5D6D"><w:t>DEFINITIONS</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="50FC2294" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="0043740D" w:rsidRDefault="00A84002" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:before="120" w:after="120"/><w:jc w:val="both"/><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="0043740D"><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Verdana" w:hAnsi="Verdana" w:cs="Times New Roman"/><w:sz w:val="20"/><w:szCs w:val="20"/></w:rPr><w:t>Unless the context otherwise requires, the following terms used in this Agreement shall have the meanings assigned to them below:</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="369341A8" w14:textId="4ECA16BF" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="00A84002" w:rsidRDefault="00A84002" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>“</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="002A35AD"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Account</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>”</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR="002A35AD"><w:t xml:space="preserve">. </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>Refers to the user account created by a User on the Platform using valid credentials and personal information, which allows the User to access and use various features of the Platform.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="699FA343" w14:textId="40CDAF25" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="00A84002" w:rsidRDefault="00A84002" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>“</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="002A35AD"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Applicable Laws</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>”</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR="002A35AD"><w:t xml:space="preserve">. </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>Means all laws, statutes, rules, regulations, notifications, circulars, guidelines, ordinances, orders, and judgments of any governmental authority or court of law applicable within the territory of the Republic of India.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="1E8CAB6F" w14:textId="05C5AD3E" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="00A84002" w:rsidRDefault="00A84002" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>“</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="002A35AD"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Business Day</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>”</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR="002A35AD"><w:t xml:space="preserve">. </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>Means any day other than a Saturday, Sunday, or a day on which banks in India are closed for business.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="326194FA" w14:textId="1DCB3E98" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="00A84002" w:rsidRDefault="00A84002" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>“</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="002A35AD"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Clubbing</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>”</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR="002A35AD"><w:t xml:space="preserve">. </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>Refers to the automatic grouping of orders placed by Users, including referred Users, using proprietary algorithms for the purpose of calculating and allocating reward incentives under the Reward Policy.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="0075883A" w14:textId="42E88A27" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="00A84002" w:rsidRDefault="00A84002" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>“</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="002A35AD"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Damndeal</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>” or “</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="002A35AD"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Company</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>”</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR="002A35AD"><w:t xml:space="preserve">. </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t xml:space="preserve">Refers to the proprietorship, partnership, or company operating under the brand name </w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellStart"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>Damndeal</w:t></w:r><w:proofErr w:type="spellEnd"/><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>, which owns, manages, and administers the Platform as an online intermediary.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2743CF64" w14:textId="7ED47E18" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="00A84002" w:rsidRDefault="00A84002" w:rsidP="0043740D"><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>“</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="002A35AD"><w:rPr><w:b/><w:bCs/></w:rPr><w:t>Order</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>”</w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidR="002A35AD"><w:t xml:space="preserve">. </w:t></w:r><w:r w:rsidRPr="00A84002"><w:t>Refers to a confirmed transaction made by a User to purchase a product listed by a Vendor on the Platform.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="2A129CEA" w14:textId="38F6678A" w:rsidR="00A84002" w:rsidRPr="00A84002" w:rsid